 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0025/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0025</a>|2026/09/14 19:48| 01 | 322| 010| 0215| 0049| 0174| 0315|    \n  <a href=\"CME0024/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0024</a>|2026/09/14 17:00| 03 | 313| 036| 0281| 0078| 0174| 0455|    \n  <a href=\"CME0023/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0023</a>|2026/09/14 11:12| 01 | 290| 006| 1836| 0058| 1736| 1851|    \n  <a href=\"CME0022/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0022</a>|2026/09/14 11:12| 01 | 268| 050| 0671| 0084| 0543| 0905|    \n  <a href=\"CME0021/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0021</a>|2026/09/13 19:36| 02 | 290| 070| 0802| 0223| 0390| 1273|    \n  <a href=\"CME0020/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0020</a>|2026/09/13 00:24| 01 | 263| 008| 030"
